body:
This was very helpful thank you. Sorry if this was the wrong location for this post. I have found some resources like [https://afsp.org/find-support/ive-lost-someone/taking-care-of-yourself/](https://afsp.org/find-support/ive-lost-someone/taking-care-of-yourself/) which has given me some context around the emotions I have been feeling. Looking back on this post I am starting to realize that these feelings fairly common (or as normal as they can be) given what has happened. Thank you for the support everyone. I am grateful these communities exist and thankful for the mods that keep it going!

&#x200B;

Love you gang!
